1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Wounded and half-frozen, Ren keeps his promise.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,000
Yuki swears she will follow him, even into death, and Ren answers that then he cannot die yet.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
They leave the burning shrine before dawn.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,500
On the rooftop, Kang waits with a drawn sword and a smile.
